From cc1bb392e9cd58f0c17d6c7aa3035b13c0ad594d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 22:40:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 426/638] [AROS] Watch AROS file paths asynchronously

Replace the AROS FilePathWatcher stub with a polling implementation that fingerprints real file metadata and sorted recursive directory contents on a blocking worker. Deliver changes back on the caller sequence and advertise recursive watches now that they are implemented.



---
